{
  "info": {
    "name": "YOB Storefront API \u2014 frontend contract",
    "description": "Request names are prefixed [AUTH] or [PUBLIC].\n\nRun login_with_password first, keep the sid cookie, and put the returned csrf_token into {{csrf_token}}.\n\nNo real credentials, session ids, payment tokens or provider secrets are stored here \u2014 every such value is a placeholder.",
